  "keyFeatures": [
    "Non-custodial agent wallet — private keys stay in Privy, agents only use nbl_live_… tokens",
    "On-chain spending policy via Soroban contract — enforced at the chain level, not config",
    "x402 payments — agents auto-pay HTTP 402 paywalls with Stellar USDC",
    "MPP (Micropayment Protocol) sessions — streaming per-call payments with budget control",
    "Automated treasury yield — idle funds auto-earn on Blend pools and return on demand",
    "Human confirmation flow — high-risk transfers require explicit human approval",
    "Stellar8004 on-chain agent reputation — every action builds a verifiable track record",
    "Remote MCP via Streamable HTTP + OAuth DCR — no stdio package required for hosted agents",
    "Works with Claude Desktop, Cursor, Claude Code, and any MCP-compatible framework"
  ],
